<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Additional Theoretical Results</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This appendix develops complementary theory for masked discrete diffusion posterior sampling. We first derive a pathwise variational bound for <em id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">training</em> a likelihood-tilted reverse process (<span id="A1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Theorem <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem A.1 (Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling(DDPS)). ‣ Appendix A Additional Theoretical Results ‣ Test-Time Anchoring for Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.1</span></a></span>), showing that <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})</annotation></semantics></math> is upper bounded by a reconstruction term, a sum of token-wise KL-divergence terms, and a sequence of measurement likelihood-based tilting terms. We then specialize this analysis to the <em id="A1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">training-free</em> setting where the token-to-image decoder is shared between unconditional generation and posterior sampling, yielding a bound for test-time anchored posterior sampling (<span id="A1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Theorem <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem2" title="Theorem A.2 (Test-time Anchored Posterior Sampling). ‣ Appendix A Additional Theoretical Results ‣ Test-Time Anchoring for Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a></span>). We provide theoretical insights drawn from each theorem in <span id="A1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Implication</span> subsections after the corresponding proofs.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_theorem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Theorem A.1</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling(DDPS))<span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="Z_{0:1}\!=\!\{Z_{t(i)}\}_{i=0}^{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.108em" rspace="0.108em">=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{0:1}\!=\!\{Z_{t(i)}\}_{i=0}^{T}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t(i)=i/T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t(i)=i/T</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s(i)=(i-1)/T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s(i)=(i-1)/T</annotation></semantics></math> be the latent path of a masked discrete diffusion model, and let <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m4" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})</annotation></semantics></math> be the forward noising law from (<a href="#S3.E3" title="In 3.1 Preliminaries ‣ 3 Method ‣ Test-Time Anchoring for Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>). Consider reverse kernels and a terminal decoder that factorize as follows:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}},Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{y}})=p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})\,p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})\,\prod_{i=1}^{T}p_{\varphi}\!\left(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}}\right)," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}},Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{y}})=p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})\,p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})\,\prod_{i=1}^{T}p_{\varphi}\!\left(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}}\right),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">with token-wise reverse transitions given by the inference posterior in (<a href="#S3.E4" title="In 3.1 Preliminaries ‣ 3 Method ‣ Test-Time Anchoring for Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>) tilted by the likelihood,</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\varphi}(Z_{s}^{l}|Z_{t},{\mathbf{y}})\;\coloneqq\;q\!\big(Z_{s}^{l}|Z_{t}^{l},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t})\big)\,q\!\big({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t})\big)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>Z</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">≔</mo><mrow><mrow><mpadded style="width:0.312em;" width="0.312em"><mi>q</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msubsup><mi>Z</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>Z</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mpadded style="width:0.312em;" width="0.312em"><mi>q</mi></mpadded><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\varphi}(Z_{s}^{l}|Z_{t},{\mathbf{y}})\;\coloneqq\;q\!\big(Z_{s}^{l}|Z_{t}^{l},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t})\big)\,q\!\big({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t})\big).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Then, for any <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}})</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx8" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex6.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\leq{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{DDPS}}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}};\varphi)\coloneqq\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}[-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>DDPS</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>≔</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{DDPS}}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}};\varphi)\coloneqq\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}[-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0})]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex7"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\Bigg[\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\;\sum_{l=1}^{L}\mathrm{CE}\!\big({\mathbf{x}}^{l},{\mathbf{x}}^{l}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)})\big)\bm{1}_{\{Z_{t(i)}^{l}={\mathbf{m}}\}}\Bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>L</mi></munderover></mstyle><mpadded style="width:1.412em;" width="1.412em"><mi>CE</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>l</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><msub><mn>𝟏</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>l</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\Bigg[\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\;\sum_{l=1}^{L}\mathrm{CE}\!\big({\mathbf{x}}^{l},{\mathbf{x}}^{l}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)})\big)\bm{1}_{\{Z_{t(i)}^{l}={\mathbf{m}}\}}\Bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E8"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E8.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad-\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\big[\log q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad-\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\big[\log q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(8)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">We present the derivation for sequence length <math id="A1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L=1</annotation></semantics></math>; the extension to <math id="A1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L&gt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math> follows by token-wise factorization as in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib44" title="" class="ltx_ref">Sohl-Dickstein et al., 2015</a>)</cite>. Recall our parameterized reverse kernel (identical in form to (<a href="#S3.E4" title="In 3.1 Preliminaries ‣ 3 Method ‣ Test-Time Anchoring for Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>) up to a likelihood tilt):</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx9" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle q(Z_{s}^{l}|Z_{t}^{l},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t}))=\begin{cases}\mathrm{Cat}(Z_{s}^{l};Z_{t}^{l}),&amp;Z_{t}^{l}\neq{\mathbf{m}},\\[2.0pt]
\mathrm{Cat}\!\Big(Z_{s}^{l};\frac{\alpha_{s}-\alpha_{t}}{1-\alpha_{t}}{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t})+\frac{1-\alpha_{s}}{1-\alpha_{t}}{\mathbf{m}}\Big),&amp;Z_{t}^{l}={\mathbf{m}}.\end{cases}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>Z</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>Z</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>Cat</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>Z</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>Z</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>Z</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo>≠</mo><mi>𝐦</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.506em;" width="1.506em"><mi>Cat</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><msubsup><mi>Z</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐦</mi></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>Z</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle q(Z_{s}^{l}|Z_{t}^{l},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t}))=\begin{cases}\mathrm{Cat}(Z_{s}^{l};Z_{t}^{l}),&amp;Z_{t}^{l}\neq{\mathbf{m}},\\[2.0pt]
\mathrm{Cat}\!\Big(Z_{s}^{l};\frac{\alpha_{s}-\alpha_{t}}{1-\alpha_{t}}{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t})+\frac{1-\alpha_{s}}{1-\alpha_{t}}{\mathbf{m}}\Big),&amp;Z_{t}^{l}={\mathbf{m}}.\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(9)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">Starting from the conditional likelihood,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx10" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex8"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex8.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=-\log\int p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}},Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{y}})\,\mathrm{d}Z_{0:1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\log\int p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}},Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{y}})\,\mathrm{d}Z_{0:1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=-\log\int p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}},Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{y}})\,\frac{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}})}{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}})}\,\mathrm{d}Z_{0:1}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\log\int p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}},Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{y}})\,\frac{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}})}{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}})}\,\mathrm{d}Z_{0:1}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text">By the conditional independence of the forward process (the noising path is conditionally independent of <math id="A1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{y}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐲</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{y}}</annotation></semantics></math> given <math id="A1.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{x}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐱</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{x}}</annotation></semantics></math>), we have <math id="A1.p3.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}})=q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}})=q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})</annotation></semantics></math>, hence</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx11" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})=-\log\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\frac{p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}},Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{y}})}{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\Bigg]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})=-\log\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\frac{p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}},Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{y}})}{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\Bigg].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">Applying Jensen’s inequality,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx12" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex11.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[-\log\frac{p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}},Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{y}})}{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\Bigg]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[-\log\frac{p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}},Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{y}})}{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\Bigg].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">Using the factorization
<math id="A1.p5.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}},Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{y}})=p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})\,p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})\,\prod_{i=1}^{T}p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}},Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{y}})=p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})\,p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})\,\prod_{i=1}^{T}p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})</annotation></semantics></math>
and the forward process factorization
<math id="A1.p5.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})=q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})\,\prod_{i=1}^{T}q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})=q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})\,\prod_{i=1}^{T}q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})</annotation></semantics></math>,
we obtain</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx13" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle-\log\frac{p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}},Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{y}})}{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\log\frac{p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}},Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{y}})}{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})+\log\frac{q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})}+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\log\frac{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})+\log\frac{q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})}+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\log\frac{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p5.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.2.1" class="ltx_text">Taking expectation under <math id="A1.p5.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})</annotation></semantics></math> yields</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx14" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex14"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex14.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\big[-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})\big]+\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Big[\log\frac{q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})}\Big]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\big[-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})\big]+\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Big[\log\frac{q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})}\Big]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Big[\log\frac{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Big]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Big[\log\frac{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Big].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text">Expanding the tilted reverse kernel using the parameterization <math id="A1.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})\coloneqq q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\,q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≔</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})\coloneqq q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\,q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))</annotation></semantics></math>, we can rewrite the last term as</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx15" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex15"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\Big[\log\frac{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))}-\log q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\Big]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\Big[\log\frac{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))}-\log q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\Big].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text">This yields the final decomposition:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx16" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex16"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex16.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\underbrace{\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}[-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})]+\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})\big)}_{\text{reconstruction + boundary KL}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>reconstruction + boundary KL</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\underbrace{\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}[-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})]+\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})\big)}_{\text{reconstruction + boundary KL}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex17"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\underbrace{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\Big[\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big)\Big]}_{\text{per-step KLs}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">+</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>per-step KLs</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\underbrace{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\Big[\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big)\Big]}_{\text{per-step KLs}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex18"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad-\underbrace{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\big[\log q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big]}_{\text{likelihood tilt terms}}\coloneqq{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{DDPS}}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}};\varphi)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>likelihood tilt terms</mtext></munder></mrow><mo>≔</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>DDPS</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad-\underbrace{\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\big[\log q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big]}_{\text{likelihood tilt terms}}\coloneqq{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{DDPS}}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}};\varphi).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text">The first two groups of terms correspond to the standard masked diffusion posterior NELBO objective <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib44" title="" class="ltx_ref">Sohl-Dickstein et al., 2015</a>; <a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">Austin et al., 2021</a>)</cite> denoted by:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx17" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex19"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\mathcal{L}}_{\text{PNELBO}}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}};\varphi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>PNELBO</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\mathcal{L}}_{\text{PNELBO}}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}};\varphi)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex19.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\coloneqq\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\big[-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})\big]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≔</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\coloneqq\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\big[-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})\big]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex20"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex20.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex21"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex21.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\Big[\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big)\Big]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\Big[\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big)\Big].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p8.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p8.2.1" class="ltx_text">The remaining likelihood terms,</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex22" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex22.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="-\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\big[\log q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big]," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">−</mo><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\big[\log q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p8.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p8.3.1" class="ltx_text">capture the effect of incorporating observations <math id="A1.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{y}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐲</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{y}}</annotation></semantics></math> into posterior sampling.
Thus, the overall objective is the PNELBO plus a sequence of likelihood corrections at every step.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text">We now bound the per-step KL terms. Having connected the decomposition to the NELBO, it suffices to compute, for each step <math id="A1.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>, the divergence</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex23" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex23.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p9.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p9.2.1" class="ltx_text">Since masked diffusion induces a two–state posterior at each step (either remain masked or reveal the data token), we treat the two cases for <math id="A1.p9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{t(i)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{t(i)}</annotation></semantics></math> separately.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p10.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Case I: <math id="A1.p10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{t(i)}={\mathbf{m}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{t(i)}={\mathbf{m}}</annotation></semantics></math>.<span id="A1.p10.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
From the masked diffusion forward process (<a href="#S3.E3" title="In 3.1 Preliminaries ‣ 3 Method ‣ Test-Time Anchoring for Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>), when <math id="A1.p10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{t(i)}={\mathbf{m}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{t(i)}={\mathbf{m}}</annotation></semantics></math> the true posterior over <math id="A1.p10.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{s(i)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{s(i)}</annotation></semantics></math> has mass</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex24" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q(Z_{s(i)}={\mathbf{m}}\mid Z_{t(i)}={\mathbf{m}},{\mathbf{x}})=\frac{1-\alpha_{s(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\!,\qquad q(Z_{s(i)}={\mathbf{x}}\mid Z_{t(i)}={\mathbf{m}},{\mathbf{x}})=\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q(Z_{s(i)}={\mathbf{m}}\mid Z_{t(i)}={\mathbf{m}},{\mathbf{x}})=\frac{1-\alpha_{s(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\!,\qquad q(Z_{s(i)}={\mathbf{x}}\mid Z_{t(i)}={\mathbf{m}},{\mathbf{x}})=\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p10.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p10.2.1" class="ltx_text">Under the model with prediction <math id="A1.p10.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)})</annotation></semantics></math> (a categorical distribution) as in (<a href="#S3.E4" title="In 3.1 Preliminaries ‣ 3 Method ‣ Test-Time Anchoring for Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>), the “unmask” branch is weighted by the model’s probability of the true token, <math id="A1.p10.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\langle{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}),{\mathbf{x}}\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\langle{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}),{\mathbf{x}}\rangle</annotation></semantics></math>, while the mask probability is unchanged. Hence,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx18" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex25"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathrm{KL}\!\big(" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">CLOSE</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathrm{KL}\!\big(</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex25.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)}\!=\!{\mathbf{m}},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)}\!=\!{\mathbf{m}},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.108em">=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.108em">=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)}\!=\!{\mathbf{m}},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)}\!=\!{\mathbf{m}},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex26"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1-\alpha_{s(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\log\frac{\frac{1-\alpha_{s(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}}{\frac{1-\alpha_{s(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}}\;+\;\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\log\frac{\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}}{\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\,\langle{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}),{\mathbf{x}}\rangle}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.502em" rspace="0.502em">+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1-\alpha_{s(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\log\frac{\frac{1-\alpha_{s(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}}{\frac{1-\alpha_{s(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}}\;+\;\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\log\frac{\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}}{\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\,\langle{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}),{\mathbf{x}}\rangle}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex27"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\log\frac{1}{\langle{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}),{\mathbf{x}}\rangle}\;=\;\frac{\alpha_{t(i)}-\alpha_{s(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\,\log\langle{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}),{\mathbf{x}}\rangle." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.337em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\log\frac{1}{\langle{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}),{\mathbf{x}}\rangle}\;=\;\frac{\alpha_{t(i)}-\alpha_{s(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\,\log\langle{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}),{\mathbf{x}}\rangle.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p10.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p10.3.1" class="ltx_text">Equivalently, writing the cross-entropy with the one-hot target <math id="A1.p10.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{x}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐱</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{x}}</annotation></semantics></math> as
<math id="A1.p10.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{CE}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))=-\log\langle{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}),{\mathbf{x}}\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>CE</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{CE}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))=-\log\langle{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}),{\mathbf{x}}\rangle</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex28" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex28.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)}\!=\!{\mathbf{m}},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)}\!=\!{\mathbf{m}},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big)=\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\,\mathrm{CE}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.108em">=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.108em">=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mi>CE</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)}\!=\!{\mathbf{m}},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)}\!=\!{\mathbf{m}},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big)=\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\,\mathrm{CE}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)})).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p11" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p11.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Case II: <math id="A1.p11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{t(i)}\neq{\mathbf{m}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>≠</mo><mi>𝐦</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{t(i)}\neq{\mathbf{m}}</annotation></semantics></math>.<span id="A1.p11.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
When the current token is already unmasked, the posterior is deterministic:
<math id="A1.p11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q(Z_{s(i)}\!=\!Z_{t(i)}\mid Z_{t(i)}\neq{\mathbf{m}},{\mathbf{x}})=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.108em">=</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>≠</mo><mi>𝐦</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q(Z_{s(i)}\!=\!Z_{t(i)}\mid Z_{t(i)}\neq{\mathbf{m}},{\mathbf{x}})=1</annotation></semantics></math>. Thus,</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex29" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex29.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)}\neq{\mathbf{m}},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)}\neq{\mathbf{m}},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big)=0." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>≠</mo><mi>𝐦</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>≠</mo><mi>𝐦</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)}\neq{\mathbf{m}},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)}\neq{\mathbf{m}},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big)=0.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p11.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p11.2.1" class="ltx_text">Only masked coordinates contribute to the per-step KL, yielding for each step <math id="A1.p11.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex30" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex30.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{s(i)}\!|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}\!|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big)=\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\;\mathrm{CE}\!\big({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)})\big)\bm{1}_{\{Z_{t(i)}={\mathbf{m}}\}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mpadded style="width:1.412em;" width="1.412em"><mi>CE</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><msub><mn>𝟏</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{s(i)}\!|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}\!|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big)=\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\;\mathrm{CE}\!\big({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)})\big)\bm{1}_{\{Z_{t(i)}={\mathbf{m}}\}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p11.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p11.3.1" class="ltx_text">This recovers the standard masked-diffusion NELBO weighting (cf. (<a href="#S3.E5" title="In 3.1 Preliminaries ‣ 3 Method ‣ Test-Time Anchoring for Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>)): per-step contributions are cross-entropies at masked positions, scaled by <math id="A1.p11.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)})/(1-\alpha_{t(i)})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)})/(1-\alpha_{t(i)})</annotation></semantics></math>.
Generalizing this to sequences with length <math id="A1.p11.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L&gt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math> yields:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex31" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex31.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big)=\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\;\sum_{l=1}^{L}\mathrm{CE}\!\big({\mathbf{x}}^{l},{\mathbf{x}}^{l}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)})\big)\bm{1}_{\{Z_{t(i)}^{l}={\mathbf{m}}\}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><munderover><mo lspace="0.447em" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>L</mi></munderover><mpadded style="width:1.412em;" width="1.412em"><mi>CE</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>l</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><msub><mn>𝟏</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>l</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}\!\mid Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big)=\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\;\sum_{l=1}^{L}\mathrm{CE}\!\big({\mathbf{x}}^{l},{\mathbf{x}}^{l}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)})\big)\bm{1}_{\{Z_{t(i)}^{l}={\mathbf{m}}\}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p11.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p11.4.1" class="ltx_text">Combining this with the likelihood tilt terms, we get</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx19" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex32"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{DDPS}}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}};\varphi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>DDPS</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{DDPS}}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}};\varphi)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex32.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}[-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})]+\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}[-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})]+\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex33"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex33.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\Bigg[\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\;\sum_{l=1}^{L}\mathrm{CE}\!\big({\mathbf{x}}^{l},{\mathbf{x}}^{l}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)})\big)\bm{1}_{\{Z_{t(i)}^{l}={\mathbf{m}}\}}\Bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>L</mi></munderover></mstyle><mpadded style="width:1.412em;" width="1.412em"><mi>CE</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>l</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><msub><mn>𝟏</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>l</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\Bigg[\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\;\sum_{l=1}^{L}\mathrm{CE}\!\big({\mathbf{x}}^{l},{\mathbf{x}}^{l}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)})\big)\bm{1}_{\{Z_{t(i)}^{l}={\mathbf{m}}\}}\Bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex34"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex34.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad-\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\big[\log q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad-\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\big[\log q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p11.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p11.5.1" class="ltx_text">In masked diffusion <math id="A1.p11.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> is typically the fully masked state or absorbing state, so <math id="A1.p11.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})</annotation></semantics></math> is degenerate and, with <math id="A1.p11.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})=q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})=q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})</annotation></semantics></math>, the boundary KL vanishes. Thus,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx20" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex35"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex35.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{DDPS}}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}};\varphi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>DDPS</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{DDPS}}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}};\varphi)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex35.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}[-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}[-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex36"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex36.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\Bigg[\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\;\sum_{l=1}^{L}\mathrm{CE}\!\big({\mathbf{x}}^{l},{\mathbf{x}}^{l}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)})\big)\bm{1}_{\{Z_{t(i)}^{l}={\mathbf{m}}\}}\Bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>L</mi></munderover></mstyle><mpadded style="width:1.412em;" width="1.412em"><mi>CE</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>l</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><msub><mn>𝟏</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>l</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\Bigg[\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\;\sum_{l=1}^{L}\mathrm{CE}\!\big({\mathbf{x}}^{l},{\mathbf{x}}^{l}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)})\big)\bm{1}_{\{Z_{t(i)}^{l}={\mathbf{m}}\}}\Bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex37"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex37.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad-\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\big[\log q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad-\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\big[\log q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p11.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p11.6.1" class="ltx_text">Furthermore, <math id="A1.p11.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{y}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐲</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{y}}</annotation></semantics></math> imposes a distribution over <math id="A1.p11.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{x}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐱</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{x}}</annotation></semantics></math> from which we wish to sample. However, when <math id="A1.p11.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> is given then <math id="A1.p11.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{x}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐱</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{x}}</annotation></semantics></math> is uniquely determined by the decoder as <math id="A1.p11.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{x}}=\mathrm{Dec}(Z_{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>Dec</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{x}}=\mathrm{Dec}(Z_{0})</annotation></semantics></math>. Therefore,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx21" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex38"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex38.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{DDPS}}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}};\varphi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>DDPS</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{DDPS}}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}};\varphi)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex38.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}[-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}[-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0})]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex39"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex39.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\Bigg[\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\;\sum_{l=1}^{L}\mathrm{CE}\!\big({\mathbf{x}}^{l},{\mathbf{x}}^{l}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)})\big)\bm{1}_{\{Z_{t(i)}^{l}={\mathbf{m}}\}}\Bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>L</mi></munderover></mstyle><mpadded style="width:1.412em;" width="1.412em"><mi>CE</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>l</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><msub><mn>𝟏</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>l</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\Bigg[\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\;\sum_{l=1}^{L}\mathrm{CE}\!\big({\mathbf{x}}^{l},{\mathbf{x}}^{l}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)})\big)\bm{1}_{\{Z_{t(i)}^{l}={\mathbf{m}}\}}\Bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex40"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex40.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad-\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\big[\log q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad-\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\big[\log q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p11.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p11.7.1" class="ltx_text">which completes the proof of the statement.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.p12" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p12.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p12.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Implications.</span>
<span id="A1.p12.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Theorem <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem A.1 (Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling(DDPS)). ‣ Appendix A Additional Theoretical Results ‣ Test-Time Anchoring for Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.1</span></a></span> provides a principled upper bound on the negative log-posterior likelihood in discrete masked diffusion models.</p>
<ul id="A1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><em id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Trainable upper bound.</em> The pathwise upper bound <math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{DDPS}}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}};\varphi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>DDPS</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{DDPS}}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}};\varphi)</annotation></semantics></math> in (<a href="#A1.Ex6" title="In Theorem A.1 (Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling(DDPS)). ‣ Appendix A Additional Theoretical Results ‣ Test-Time Anchoring for Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>) provides a principled training criterion for discrete diffusion posterior sampling.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><em id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Reduction to standard training when <math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{y}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐲</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{y}}</annotation></semantics></math> is absent.</em> Setting the likelihood to a constant (no measurements) removes the tilt terms and recovers the masked-diffusion training objective: only the reconstruction term and per-step KL-divergence terms remain.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><em id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Masked-token supervision.</em> The per-step KL-divergence terms vanish on already-revealed tokens and reduce to weighted cross-entropies on masked tokens, focusing learning signal exactly where denoising must occur. The weights <math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)})/(1-\alpha_{t(i)})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)})/(1-\alpha_{t(i)})</annotation></semantics></math> expose how the noise schedule shapes gradient magnitude.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><em id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Data-consistency via tilt.</em> The additive terms <math id="A1.I1.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="-\sum_{i}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}[\log q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">−</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-\sum_{i}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}[\log q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))]</annotation></semantics></math> encourage reverse transitions that produce intermediate predictions consistent with the measurement model, integrating task specific information at every denoising step.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><em id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Boundary conditions.</em> With an absorbing mask state, the boundary KL-divergence is constant (often zero), so optimization concentrates on reconstruction, token-level KL-divergence terms, and measurement consistency.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><em id="A1.I1.i6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Compatibility with efficient parameterizations.</em> Because (<a href="#A1.Ex6" title="In Theorem A.1 (Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling(DDPS)). ‣ Appendix A Additional Theoretical Results ‣ Test-Time Anchoring for Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>) is written in terms of token-wise categoricals, it directly supports time-independent or lightweight parameterizations (e.g., shared denoisers), helping scalability to long sequences and high resolution.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_theorem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Theorem A.2</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Test-time Anchored Posterior Sampling)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="Z_{0:1}=\{Z_{t(i)}\}_{i=0}^{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{0:1}=\{Z_{t(i)}\}_{i=0}^{T}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t(i)=i/T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t(i)=i/T</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s(i)=(i-1)/T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s(i)=(i-1)/T</annotation></semantics></math> denote the latent path of a masked discrete diffusion model, and let <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m4" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})</annotation></semantics></math> be the forward noising law from (<a href="#S3.E3" title="In 3.1 Preliminaries ‣ 3 Method ‣ Test-Time Anchoring for Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>). Assume the decoder is shared between unconditional generation and posterior sampling (<math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0})=p_{\theta}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0})=p_{\theta}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0})</annotation></semantics></math>), and the unconditional reverse transitions are parameterized as in (<a href="#S3.E4" title="In 3.1 Preliminaries ‣ 3 Method ‣ Test-Time Anchoring for Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>). Define <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{NELBO}}({\mathbf{x}};\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>NELBO</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{NELBO}}({\mathbf{x}};\theta)</annotation></semantics></math> as in (<a href="#S3.E5" title="In 3.1 Preliminaries ‣ 3 Method ‣ Test-Time Anchoring for Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>). Then, for any <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}})</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex41" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex41.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})\;\leq\;{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{APS}}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}};\varphi)," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">≤</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>APS</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})\;\leq\;{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{APS}}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}};\varphi),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx22" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex42"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex42.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{APS}}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}};\varphi)\coloneqq{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{NELBO}}({\mathbf{x}};\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>APS</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≔</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>NELBO</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{APS}}({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{y}};\varphi)\coloneqq{\mathcal{L}}_{\mathrm{NELBO}}({\mathbf{x}};\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex42.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\,\log\frac{\langle{\mathbf{x}}_{\theta}(Z_{t(i)}),{\mathbf{x}}\rangle}{\langle{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}),{\mathbf{x}}\rangle}\,\bm{1}_{\{Z_{t(i)}={\mathbf{m}}\}}\Bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><msub><mn class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold"> 1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\,\log\frac{\langle{\mathbf{x}}_{\theta}(Z_{t(i)}),{\mathbf{x}}\rangle}{\langle{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}),{\mathbf{x}}\rangle}\,\bm{1}_{\{Z_{t(i)}={\mathbf{m}}\}}\Bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex43"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex43.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle-\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\big[\log q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\big[\log q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\big].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.3" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.p13" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p13.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p13.1.1" class="ltx_text">From the proof of <span id="A1.p13.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Theorem <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem A.1 (Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling(DDPS)). ‣ Appendix A Additional Theoretical Results ‣ Test-Time Anchoring for Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.1</span></a></span>, the conditional likelihood satisfies</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx23" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex44"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex44.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex44.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\big[-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})\big]+\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Big[\log\frac{q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})}\Big]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\big[-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})\big]+\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Big[\log\frac{q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})}\Big]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E11.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Big[\log\frac{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Big]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Big[\log\frac{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Big].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p13.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p13.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Compute each term inside summation.<span id="A1.p13.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
We now focus on the <math id="A1.p13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i^{th}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i^{th}</annotation></semantics></math> term inside the summation. Using the pretrained network <math id="A1.p13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)})</annotation></semantics></math> as given in (<a href="#S3.E4" title="In 3.1 Preliminaries ‣ 3 Method ‣ Test-Time Anchoring for Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>), we decompose the term as:</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx24" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex45"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex45.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\log\frac{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\log\frac{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex46"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex46.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\log\frac{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)})}+\log\frac{p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Bigg]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\log\frac{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)})}+\log\frac{p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Bigg].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p13.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p13.3.1" class="ltx_text">Isolating the first-term as a KL-divergence term, this yields</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx25" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex47"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex47.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\log\frac{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\log\frac{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex48"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex48.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\underbrace{\mathrm{KL}\!\Big(q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)})\Big)}_{\text{divergence w.r.t.\ pretrained network}}+\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\log\frac{p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Bigg]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>divergence w.r.t. pretrained network</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\underbrace{\mathrm{KL}\!\Big(q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)})\Big)}_{\text{divergence w.r.t.\ pretrained network}}+\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\log\frac{p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Bigg].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p13.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p13.4.1" class="ltx_text">Since <math id="A1.p13.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)})</annotation></semantics></math> is parameterized via the pretrained network prediction <math id="A1.p13.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{x}}_{\theta}(Z_{t(i)})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{x}}_{\theta}(Z_{t(i)})</annotation></semantics></math>, we get</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex49" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex49.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathrm{KL}\!\Big(q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\Big)=\mathrm{KL}\!\Big(q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\theta}(Z_{t(i)}))\Big)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{KL}\!\Big(q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\Big)=\mathrm{KL}\!\Big(q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\theta}(Z_{t(i)}))\Big).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p13.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p13.5.1" class="ltx_text">Following the argument of <span id="A1.p13.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Theorem <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem A.1 (Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling(DDPS)). ‣ Appendix A Additional Theoretical Results ‣ Test-Time Anchoring for Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.1</span></a></span>, we distinguish two cases for <math id="A1.p13.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{t(i)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{t(i)}</annotation></semantics></math>. For <math id="A1.p13.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{t(i)}={\mathbf{m}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{t(i)}={\mathbf{m}}</annotation></semantics></math>, the KL-divergence evaluates to</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex50" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex50.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\theta}(Z_{t(i)}))\big)=\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\,\mathrm{CE}\!\big({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{x}}_{\theta}(Z_{t(i)})\big)," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.431em;" width="1.431em"><mi>KL</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mpadded style="width:1.412em;" width="1.412em"><mi>CE</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{KL}\!\big(q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})\,\|\,q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\theta}(Z_{t(i)}))\big)=\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\,\mathrm{CE}\!\big({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{x}}_{\theta}(Z_{t(i)})\big),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p13.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p13.6.1" class="ltx_text">while for <math id="A1.p13.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{t(i)}\neq{\mathbf{m}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>≠</mo><mi>𝐦</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{t(i)}\neq{\mathbf{m}}</annotation></semantics></math> the KL-divergence vanishes. Thus we obtain</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx26" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex51"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex51.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\log\frac{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\log\frac{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex52"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex52.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\,\mathrm{CE}\!\big({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{x}}_{\theta}(Z_{t(i)})\big)\,\bm{1}_{\{Z_{t(i)}={\mathbf{m}}\}}+\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\log\frac{p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Bigg]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mpadded style="width:1.412em;" width="1.412em"><mi>CE</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><msub><mn class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold"> 1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\,\mathrm{CE}\!\big({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{x}}_{\theta}(Z_{t(i)})\big)\,\bm{1}_{\{Z_{t(i)}={\mathbf{m}}\}}+\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\log\frac{p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Bigg].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p13.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p13.7.1" class="ltx_text">Substituting the above expression in the conditional likelihood (<a href="#A1.Ex44" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix A Additional Theoretical Results ‣ Test-Time Anchoring for Discrete Diffusion Posterior Sampling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>), we get</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx27" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex53"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex53.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|{\mathbf{y}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex53.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\big[-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})\big]+\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Big[\log\frac{q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})}\Big]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{0:1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\big[-\log p_{\varphi}({\mathbf{x}}|Z_{0},{\mathbf{y}})\big]+\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Big[\log\frac{q(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{x}})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{1}|{\mathbf{y}})}\Big]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex54"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex54.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\,\mathrm{CE}\!\big({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{x}}_{\theta}(Z_{t(i)})\big)\,\bm{1}_{\{Z_{t(i)}={\mathbf{m}}\}}\Bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mpadded style="width:1.412em;" width="1.412em"><mi>CE</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><msub><mn class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold"> 1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>𝐦</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\frac{\alpha_{s(i)}-\alpha_{t(i)}}{1-\alpha_{t(i)}}\,\mathrm{CE}\!\big({\mathbf{x}},{\mathbf{x}}_{\theta}(Z_{t(i)})\big)\,\bm{1}_{\{Z_{t(i)}={\mathbf{m}}\}}\Bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E12.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\log\frac{p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Bigg]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{i=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{t(i)}|{\mathbf{x}})}\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\log\frac{p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Bigg].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p14" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p14.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p14.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Expected log-likelihood ratio under <math id="A1.p14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q</annotation></semantics></math>.<span id="A1.p14.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
We now examine the expected difference in log-likelihoods between the prior and posterior transition distributions under the conditional law of the forward process.
Recall that the reverse transition under our parameterization is</span></span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex55" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex55.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})=q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\,q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})=q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)}))\,q({\mathbf{y}}|{\mathbf{x}}_{\varphi}(Z_{t(i)})).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p15" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p15.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p15.1.1" class="ltx_text">Consider the expectation of the log-likelihood ratio under the forward posterior <math id="A1.p15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx28" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex56"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex56.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\log\frac{p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Bigg]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{q(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{x}})}\!\Bigg[\log\frac{p_{\theta}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)})}{p_{\varphi}(Z_{s(i)}|Z_{t(i)},{\mathbf{y}})}\Bigg].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
