<p id="A1.p15.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p15.2.1" class="ltx_text">Substituting the definition of <math id="A1.p15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\varphi}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>φ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\varphi}</annotation></semantics></math>, we obtain</span></p>
